    "description": "KDRIVE-016 (kDrive): support confirmed a sync bug with unlucky timing. Rules A7, E2 and C1: a pass that resumes after the drive moved on writes nothing stale back; the next pass brings the newest version; no upload of the old copy, no conflict.",
